# Compiled binaries
/sc-component-notifier
/plugin/sc-component-notifier
/service/notifier
/dist/
/bin/

# Local SC state + secrets (gitignored per fleet CLAUDE.md — only encrypted
# .sc/secrets.yaml registries are committed).
/.sc/state/
/.sc/stacks/*/secrets.yaml
/.sc/cfg.github.yaml

# Go
/plugin/vendor/
/api/vendor/
/service/vendor/

# Node
/service/internal/ui/node_modules/

# NOTE: internal/ui/dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The SPA bundle is
# COMMITTED, because the Dockerfile has no Node stage — the Go binary
# embeds dist/ with go:embed, and an embed of a missing directory is a
# compile error, not a warning. sc-component-observatory does the same
# (it has no .gitignore at all and commits its three dist files). The
# template this repo was copied from ignored the directory, which would
# have failed the first image build with a confusing
# "pattern dist: no matching files found".
#
# Consequence to remember: a SPA change needs `make ui` + the rebuilt
# bundle committed, or the deployed service serves the previous UI while
# the Go side is new.

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
